  "doc": "M4-A2P-058: the Act II bosses' own ambient VFX (CreatureAmbientVfx, game/creatures/ambient_vfx/creature_ambient_vfx.gd, a child of each boss's battle scene). Effects that belong to the creature's body, not a skill's (skills are battle-presentation's, game/data/vfx/battle/effects.json). Each boss's art sheet (docs/kb/art/creatures/act2/<id>.md, 'Own VFX') says what each effect is and why. Kinds: particles (a GPUParticles3D on a bone: emit 'always' or {clip: [from_sec, to_sec]}; or one-shot bursts {clip: at_sec}, every_sec [min, max] (every_sec_by_phase), ko_at_sec, on_hidden <node>), halo (a steady billboard on each of `bones`) and light (an OmniLight3D). at_m: the spot in the model's rest pose (model axes); offset_m: a shift from the bone's head; pin_y_m: held level at that model height (the water line). Colours are palette swatches (docs/kb/art/palette.json) with their hex; a particle's colours run evenly over its life, blended in Oklab, times energy; alpha is [birth, peak, death] with the peak at peak_at; grow is its size at birth and death times size_m. Every emitter has a fixed seed. ko_dark: halos and lights go dark from at_sec after the KO over sec.",
